#: e30c26ca153e4bd9aa652feeb1a40156
msgid "1. Environment Setup"
msgstr "1\\. 環境セットアップ"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:20004
#: 555f48520fd6453a8959b80f6251c275
msgid ""
"First, we import the necessary libraries and generate sample data for "
"demonstration."
msgstr "まずは必要なライブラリをインポートし、デモ用のサンプルデータを生成します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:40002
#: 48e77c0432324792800d73983d1f755a
msgid "2. Signal Processing and Demodulation"
msgstr "2\\. 信号処理と復調"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:40004
#: 2b16700c34594411af22a2021db7f7ea
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` integrates Hilbert transforms, envelope calculations, instantaneous"
" frequency computation, and demodulation functions like lock-in amplifiers."
msgstr "`gwexpy` では、ヒルベルト変換や包絡線、瞬時周波数の計算、さらにロックインアンプのような復調機能が統合されています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:50002
#: 8bfe9d18901f4ab18127878458038e6d
msgid "Hilbert Transform and Envelope"
msgstr "ヒルベルト変換と包絡線"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:50004
#: 58009e1aeb294adf82b521416ddf63a1
msgid "Use `hilbert` and `envelope`."
msgstr "`hilbert` と `envelope` を使用します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:70002
#: 06f368dc2bfc46639a175337d26a7d3e
msgid "Instantaneous Phase and Instantaneous Frequency"
msgstr "瞬時位相と瞬時周波数"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:70004
#: 8af11f709b324502a6aa806f8404a337
msgid ""
"Use `instantaneous_phase` and `instantaneous_frequency`. You can specify "
"phase unwrapping (`unwrap`) and degree units (`deg`)."
msgstr ""
"`instantaneous_phase` と `instantaneous_frequency` を使用します。位相のアンラップ (`unwrap`)"
" や度の単位 (`deg`) も指定可能です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:90002
#: ffad0798a43541a88eecd34a7e533c2e
msgid "Mixing and Demodulation (Mix-down, Baseband, Lock-in)"
msgstr "混合と復調 (Mix-down, Baseband, Lock-in)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:90004
#: 8ac7eacbc66f43d1855f95ebc51c35d5
msgid ""
"Functions for extracting specific frequency components or bringing them down"
" to baseband."
msgstr "特定の周波数成分を抽出したり、直流成分へ落とし込むための機能です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:110002
#: 7551327d6ee049c583e6f3a4fd9a8eb1
msgid "3. Spectral Analysis and Correlation"
msgstr "3\\. スペクトル解析と相関"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:110004
#: cb6824e2592446d681774af90e243ed8
msgid ""
"While inheriting GWpy's functionality, `mode=\"transient\"` FFT for "
"transient signals and transfer function calculation via direct FFT ratio "
"have been added."
msgstr ""
"GWpy の機能を継承しつつ、過渡信号向けの `mode=\"transient\"` FFT と、FFT 比を直接とる伝達関数計算が追加されています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:120002
#: 042a99803ded438fa244eb215fb239b0
msgid "Extended FFT"
msgstr "拡張された FFT"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:120004
#: 1e3b134945534449be9f4de85f67f4ca
msgid ""
"Using `mode=\"transient\"` enables zero-padding, adjustment to fast lengths,"
" and individual left/right padding specifications."
msgstr "`mode=\"transient\"` を使うと、ゼロパディング、高速長への調整、左右個別のパディング指定が可能になります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:140002
#: e7d5504cb5734bcdaf0385396e8554b7
msgid "Transfer Function and Cross-Correlation (xcorr)"
msgstr "伝達関数 (Transfer Function) と相互相関 (xcorr)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:140004
#: 2d2651df6e3f45a78e714d4b8264dcf6
msgid ""
"With `transfer_function`, you can choose not only the Welch method "
"(`mode=\"steady\"`) but also direct FFT ratio (`mode=\"transient\"`)."
msgstr ""
"`transfer_function` では、Welch 法（`mode=\"steady\"`）だけでなく、FFT "
"比を直接とる方法（`mode=\"transient\"`）も選択できます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:160002
#: 6da6fa710e95491d83dc6279b74233aa
msgid "STLT (Short-Time Laplace Transform)"
msgstr "STLT (Short-Time Laplace Transform)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:160004
#: fdeb6caa29fe4d4fb6332cd087845334
msgid ""
"STLT (Short-Time Laplace Transform) is a transform for extracting local "
"structures that change over time in a signal."
msgstr "STLT（短時間ラプラス変換）は、信号の中で時間とともに変化する局所構造を抽出するための変換です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:160006
#: bcb1f4817e93485e860680ed9dc72545
msgid ""
"In `gwexpy`, the STLT result is a 3D transform with axes **(time × sigma × "
"frequency)**, represented by `TimePlaneTransform` / `LaplaceGram`."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy` では、STLT の結果は **(時間 × シグマ × 周波数)** を軸とする 3 "
"次元変換で、`TimePlaneTransform` / `LaplaceGram` として表現されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:160008
#: ab30905005c1476b9acc7e75317cb6e5
msgid ""
"Below is an example of calculating STLT using the `stlt` method and "
"extracting a slice (`Plane2D`) at a specific time. This example also "
"demonstrates specifying `frequencies` (Hz) to evaluate STLT at arbitrary "
"frequency points."
msgstr ""
"以下は、`stlt` メソッドで STLT を計算し、特定時刻のスライス（`Plane2D`）を取り出す例です。この例では、任意の周波数点で STLT "
"を評価するための `frequencies`（Hz）指定もあわせて示します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:180002
#: ab26839c45684f1593e2167ff4909585
msgid "4. Hilbert-Huang Transform (HHT)"
msgstr "4\\. ヒルベルト・ファン変換 (HHT)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:180004
#: 66a75a37baf24838bf4e7e6c53546041
msgid ""
"Hilbert-Huang Transform (HHT) functionality for nonlinear and non-stationary"
" signal analysis. Combines Empirical Mode Decomposition (EMD) and Hilbert "
"spectral analysis."
msgstr ""
"非線形・非定常な信号解析のためのヒルベルト・ファン変換 (HHT) 機能です。経験的モード分解 (EMD) "
"とヒルベルトスペクトル解析を組み合わせています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:200002
#: 1607ca4496004efe8700347d245589c9
msgid "5. Statistics and Preprocessing"
msgstr "5\\. 統計・前処理"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:200004
#: 2bfff6927e7b42cfac74fdacd8943512
msgid ""
"Missing value imputation, standardization, ARIMA models, Hurst exponent, and"
" rolling statistics are available as TimeSeries methods."
msgstr "欠損値補完、標準化、ARIMA モデル、ハースト指数、ローリング統計量が TimeSeries のメソッドとして利用できます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:220002
#: 68858d013c134e6b8874283652a47a3a
msgid "Peak Detection (Find Peaks)"
msgstr "ピーク検出 (Find Peaks)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:220004
#: e7737abda31b4a7ba7dea7787f6a8e8d
msgid "Wraps `scipy.signal.find_peaks` to detect peaks in time series data."
msgstr "`scipy.signal.find_peaks` をラップして、時系列データのピークを検出します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:240002
#: 133b2687cec44c268db0d73f00e04a66
msgid "ARIMA Model and Hurst Exponent"
msgstr "ARIMA モデルとハースト指数"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:240004
#: d855e6cf70d94fcaafff923b350c3d3c
msgid ""
"Note: These features require libraries such as `statsmodels` and `hurst`."
msgstr "注意: これらの機能には `statsmodels` や `hurst` などのライブラリが必要です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:260002
#: 6adf8ccba47a4bdfa55fb9da89658683
msgid "Rolling Statistics"
msgstr "ローリング統計量 (Rolling Statistics)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:260004
#: 43a49441690541c39d0702c5092becab
msgid ""
"Similar to Pandas, `rolling_mean`, `std`, `median`, `min`, `max` are "
"available."
msgstr "Pandas と同様に、`rolling_mean`・`std`・`median`・`min`・`max` が利用できます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:280002
#: 9762d3dc25f84162979b1932958f0719
msgid "6. Resampling and Reindexing"
msgstr "6\\. リサンプリングと再インデックス"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:280004
#: 42bb10bc87db4e87a84d1334ed02abbd
msgid ""
"The `asfreq` method allows assignment to a fixed grid, and the `resample` "
"method enables \"time bin aggregation\"."
msgstr "`asfreq` メソッドで固定グリッドへの割り当てが、`resample` メソッドで「時間ビンごとの集約」ができます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:310002
#: 53b0513d50a44d0283c821571e083ed2
msgid "7. Function Fitting"
msgstr "7\\. 関数によるフィッティング"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:310004
#: 51bb6f127365467cbc535013f33e2e5a
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` provides powerful fitting functionality based on `iminuit`. To "
"avoid polluting GWpy's original classes, the `.fit()` method is opt-in."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy` は `iminuit` ベースの強力なフィッティング機能を提供します。GWpy 本来のクラスを汚染しないよう、`.fit()` "
"メソッドはオプトイン方式です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:330002
#: 64758469d10146f1868b33c4c9713f39
msgid "8. Interoperability"
msgstr "8\\. 相互運用性"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:330004
#: b905a6b1bcdd4d53b4ca15ec8c22f347
msgid ""
"Interconversion with major data science and machine learning libraries is "
"very smooth."
msgstr "主要なデータサイエンス・機械学習ライブラリとの相互変換が非常にスムーズに行えます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:390002
#: e5247b0cd3b14003a8a86fe62182e3a0
msgid "Summary"
