msgstr "**統計**: 高度な相関手法 (MIC, Distance Correlation) と ARIMA モデリング。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:390008
#: 937277555a1d4029becc76377ba66b55
