#: 1420385d41ad476dafc6b40d10bc35e5
msgid ""
"**Multichannel Data**: Learn about "
"[TimeSeriesMatrix](matrix_timeseries.ipynb) for handling many channels "
"simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"**多チャンネルデータ**: [TimeSeriesMatrix](matrix_timeseries.ipynb) "
"で多数のチャンネルを一括処理する方法を学ぶ。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:390014
#: 85e973a182c2423c88561d38d41d2ec0
msgid ""
"**Spectral Analysis**: Explore "
"[FrequencySeries](intro_frequencyseries.ipynb)."
msgstr "**スペクトル解析**: [FrequencySeries](intro_frequencyseries.ipynb) を詳しく見る。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_timeseries.ipynb:390015
